fix: AI生成请求改走SillyTavern后端代理避免CORS

callResponsesApiDirect_ACU和callCompletionsApiDirect_ACU原先直接
fetch外部API被CORS阻止,导致发送消息失败

改为走/api/backends/chat-completions/generate后端代理:
- chat_completion_source='custom'
- custom_url传用户URL
- custom_include_headers传Authorization
- custom_api_format根据端点类型设openai_compat或openai_responses
- custom_include_body/custom_exclude_body透传附加参数